@gateway = http://localhost:7000
@userService = http://localhost:7001
@baseUrl = {{gateway}}/api

### Variables for testing
@username = testuser
@email = test@example.com
@password = TestPassword123!

###
# Gateway Tests
###

### Gateway Health Check
GET {{gateway}}/health

### Gateway Info
GET {{gateway}}/api/gateway/info

### Gateway Services Discovery
GET {{gateway}}/api/gateway/services

###
# Direct User Service Tests (for comparison)
###

### User Service Health Check (Direct)
GET {{userService}}/health

### User Service Swagger (Direct)
GET {{userService}}/swagger/index.html

###
# Authentication Tests (Through Gateway)
###

### Register a new user (Through Gateway)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890"
}

### Login (Through Gateway)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### Extract token from login response
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}

### Check Username Availability (Through Gateway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/check-username/newuser123

### Check Email Availability (Through Gateway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/check-email/newuser@example.com

###
# Authenticated User Tests (Through Gateway)
###

### Get User Profile (Through Gateway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get User Roles (Through Gateway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get User Sessions (Through Gateway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update User Profile (Through Gateway)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John Updated",
  "lastName": "Doe Updated",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567891",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01"
}

### Change Password (Through Gateway)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "NewTestPassword123!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewTestPassword123!"
}

### Refresh Token (Through Gateway)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (Through Gateway)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###
# Gateway Routing Tests
###

### User Service Health through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/services/users/health

### Test Invalid Route (should return 404)
GET {{gateway}}/api/invalid/endpoint

###
# Error Handling Tests
###

### Test Authentication Required
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile

### Test Invalid Credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "invaliduser",
  "password": "invalidpassword"
}

### Test Invalid Registration (missing fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2"
}

### Test Duplicate User Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}